hadiths[16]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1097","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Chor ka hath chauthayi deenar mein kaata jayega."
"1098","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chor ka hath dhal mein kaata jis ki qeemat teen dirham thi."
"1099","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke hawale se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah chor par lanat kare. Anda churata hai to us ka hath kaata jata hai. Aur rassi churata hai to us ka hath kaata jata hai."
"1100","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Quraish ko us Makhzumi aurat ke mamle ne fikr mein dala jis ne chori ki thi. Phir kaha: Aur kaun Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se us mein baat karega? Phir unhon ne kaha: Aur Usama bin Zaid ke siwa kaun Aap par jurrat karega, jo Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke mehboob hain? Phir Usama ne Aap se baat ki. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum Allah ki had mein se ek had mein sifarish karte ho? Phir Aap khade hue aur khutba diya. Phir farmaya: Tum se pehle walon ko isi ne halak kiya ke wo aise they ke jab un mein shareef chori karta to use chhor dete, aur jab un mein kamzor chori karta to us par had qayam karte. Allah ki qasam! Agar Fatima bint Muhammad chori karti to main us ka hath kaat-ta."
"1101","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umar bin al-Khattab (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke beshak Allah ne Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko haq ke sath bheja aur Aap par kitab nazil farmayi. Phir jo Allah ne nazil farmaya us mein rajm ki ayat thi. Phir hum ne use parha, samjha aur yaad rakha. Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne rajm farmaya aur hum ne Aap ke baad rajm kiya. Phir mujhe dar hai ke agar logon par zamana lamba ho jaye to kehne wala kahega: Allah ki qasam! Hum Allah ki kitab mein rajm ki ayat nahi pate. Phir wo us farz ko tark karke gumrah hon jo Allah ne nazil farmaya. Aur rajm Allah ki kitab mein haq hai us par jo zina kare jab shadi-shuda ho, mardon aur aurton mein se, jab daleel qayam ho ya hamal ya iqrar ho."
"1102","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah aur Jabir (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, Abu Hurairah ne kaha: Ek shakhs Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya jabke Wo masjid mein they. Phir us ne Aap ko pukara aur arz kiya: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak main ne zina kiya hai. To Aap ne us se munh phera, yahan tak ke us ne Aap par chaar martaba doharaya. Phir jab us ne apne aap par chaar gawahiyan deen to Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use bulaya aur farmaya: Kya tumhe junoon hai? Us ne arz kiya: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum shadi-shuda ho? Us ne arz kiya: Haan. Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Use le jao aur rajm karo. Jabir ne kaha: Phir main un mein tha jinhon ne use rajm kiya. Phir hum ne use Eidgah mein rajm kiya. Phir jab use patharon ne takleef di to wo bhaga. Phir hum ne use Harra mein paya aur rajm kiya."
"1103","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah aur Zaid bin Khalid al-Juhani (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, un dono ne kaha: Ek shakhs Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Main tumhe Allah ki qasam deta hun ke hamare darmiyan Allah ki kitab se faisla farmayiye. Phir us ka hareef khada hua jo us se zyada samajhdar tha. Phir us ne kaha: Us ne sach kaha. Hamare darmiyan Allah ki kitab se faisla farmayiye aur mujhe ijazat dijiye Ya Rasulullah! Phir Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Kaho. Phir us ne kaha: Beshak mera beta is ke ghar walon mein mazdoor tha. Phir us ne us ki biwi se zina kiya. Phir main ne us se sau bakriyon aur khadim se fidya diya. Aur beshak main ne ilm walon mein se mardon se poochha. Phir unhon ne mujhe khabar di ke mere bete par sau kode aur ek saal jila-watani hai, aur is ki biwi par rajm hai. To Aap ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai! Main tumhare darmiyan Allah ki kitab se zaroor faisla karunga. Sau aur khadim tumhe laute hue hain. Aur tumhare bete par sau kode aur ek saal jila-watani hai. Aur ae Unais! Is ki biwi ke paas subah jao aur us se poochho. Phir agar wo iqrar kare to use rajm karo. Phir us ne iqrar kiya. Phir us ne use rajm kiya."
"1104","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Yahood Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaye. Phir unhon ne Aap se zikr kiya ke un mein se ek mard aur aurat ne zina kiya hai. To Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Tum Taurat mein rajm ke mamle mein kya pate ho? To unhon ne kaha: Hum unhe ruswa karte hain aur kode marte hain. To Abdullah bin Salam ne kaha: Tum ne jhoot bola. Beshak us mein rajm hai. Phir wo Taurat lekar aaye aur use phailaya. Phir un mein se ek ne apna hath rajm ki ayat par rakha. Phir us se pehle aur baad parha. To Abdullah bin Salam ne us se kaha: Apna hath uthao. Phir us ne apna hath uthaya. Phir us mein rajm ki ayat thi. To unhon ne kaha: Tum ne sach kaha ae Muhammad! Us mein rajm ki ayat hai. Phir Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un dono ka hukm diya. Phir wo rajm kiye gaye. Abdullah bin Umar ne kaha: Phir main ne mard ko dekha ke wo aurat par jhukta tha, use patharon se bachata tha."
"1105","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Aufa se Shaibani ke hawale se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Abi Aufa se poochha: Kya Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne rajm farmaya? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Main ne kaha: Surah Noor se pehle ya baad? Unhon ne kaha: Main nahi janta."
"1106","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab londi zina kare aur us ka zina zahir ho jaye to use kode mare aur malamat na kare. Phir agar zina kare to use kode mare aur malamat na kare. Phir agar teesri martaba zina kare to use beche agarche baal ki rassi se."
"1107","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah aur Zaid bin Khalid (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se londi ke bare mein poochha gaya jab wo zina kare aur shadi-shuda na ho. Aap ne farmaya: Agar zina kare to use kode maro. Phir agar zina kare to use kode maro. Phir agar zina kare to use becho agarche rassi se."
"1108","[AI-translation] Hazrat Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne sharab mein khajoor ki tehniyon aur jootiyon se kode mare. Aur Abu Bakr ne chalees kode mare."
"1109","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ali bin Abi Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main kisi par had qayam na karunga aur wo mar jaye to apne dil mein payun, siwaye sharab wale ke. Kyunke agar wo mar jata to main diyat deta. Aur ye is liye ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne use sunnat nahi banaya."
"1110","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Burda (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi Karim (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) farmate they: Dus kodon se upar kode na mare jayein, magar Allah ki had mein se ek had mein."
"1111","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ubada bin al-Samit (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, jo Badr mein hazir hue they, jo Aqaba ki raat naqibon mein se ek they: Ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya jabke Aap ke ird-gird Aap ke sathiyon ki ek jamaat thi: Mujh se bai'at karo ke tum Allah ke sath kisi cheez ko shareek nahi karoge, chori nahi karoge, zina nahi karoge, apni aulad ko qatl nahi karoge, aisa bohtan na laoge jo tum apne hathon aur paon ke darmiyan ghadte ho, neki mein na-farmani nahi karoge. Phir tum mein se jo wafa kare us ka ajr Allah par hai. Aur jo is mein se koi cheez kare aur duniya mein saza paye to wo us ke liye kaffara hai. Aur jo is mein se koi cheez kare phir Allah use chhupaye to wo Allah ki taraf hai. Agar chahe use muaf kare, agar chahe use azab de. Phir hum ne Aap se is par bai'at ki."
"1112","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Be-zaban janwar ka nuqsan zaya hai, kunwan zaya hai, khadan zaya hai. Aur dafan khazane mein panchwan hai."
